Date: Wed, 28 Aug 2024 18:31:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Control WLAN EP power in RC driver

Add wlan ep power control api
Unify code for shutdown and wow with micro
Remove irq interrupt resource which used by rc
export platform_rc_pm_control

Signed-off-by: Ming Jiang <quic_mjiang@quicinc.com>
---
